# Code owners — who reviews what.
#
# This file is the ONLY place ownership is recorded. image.yml has no `owners`
# field on purpose: a copied manifest names last year's instructor, and GitHub
# routes reviews from this file regardless, so the two would silently disagree.
# See docs/DESIGN.md.
#
# Onboarding an instructor is uncommenting one line and replacing the
# placeholder with their GitHub username. A class directory covers every
# semester under it (cs341/fa26/, cs341/sp27/, ...) and the class-level
# CommentsForClass.md and Dockerfile.suggested.
#
# Last matching pattern wins, so the default line must stay first.

# Default owner: workflows, validation, shared docs, and any class not
# claimed below.
